    "bio": "Dr. Jerry Yang serves as the Executive Director of Kai Ming Head Start, leading the organization’s efforts to provide high-quality early childhood education, health, nutrition, and family support services to low-income families in San Francisco. His professional background includes experience as a preschool teacher, assistant professor, and education administrator. He is committed to fostering warm, respectful, culturally responsive, and data-informed learning environments, while also advocating for the professional development and equitable representation of Asian early childhood educators.",
